summary:
  A mount twin no longer needs its host to be a numbered sibling of the saved
  one.

history:
  edge02 and edge43 are one server family; some other host of the same domain
  serving the same path need not be. Only an answer from the family proves the
  sound is the saved mount.

target:
  package/contents/ui/HealLogic.js

find:
      return a.host.replace(/\d+/g, "#") === b.host.replace(/\d+/g, "#");

replace:
      return true;

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_heallogic.qml::test_the_same_mount_on_a_sibling_edge_is_the_same_station.
  Line-neutral.
